@startuml
title 应用职责、端口与宿主边界（2026-11 当前态）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty members

package "核心领域与规则" {
  class Workshop
  class Order
  class ProducerModule
  class LiquidProduction
  class Warehouse
  class ModifierStack
  class WorldQuery
  class ISolver <<interface>>
  class IWorkBudgetedSolver <<interface>>
}

package "过程与运行时" {
  class ProcessSystem
  class TickPipeline
  class WorldScheduler
  class WorldBus
  class WorldTime
  class IWorldEventSource <<interface>>
  class IProcessAdvancer <<interface>>
  class IProcessObserver <<interface>>
}

package "应用服务" {
  class JarSystem {
    +Orders : IReadOnlyList
    +Workshops : IReadOnlyList
    +Processes : ProcessSystem
    +GetState() : StateDto
    +Tick(count) : int
  }

  class "JarSystem.Runtime" as RuntimePart <<partial>>
  class WorkshopService
  class OrderService
  class ProductionService
  class MasterSwitchCoordinator
}

package "读模型与回放" {
  class StateSerializer
  class StateDto
  class WorldCommand
  class SessionReplay
  class ProcessJournal
}

package "宿主" {
  class JarSystemService {
    +System : JarSystem
    +Gate : SemaphoreSlim
    +LoadLevel(index)
    +RestartLevel()
  }

  class CommandDispatcher
  class WebSocketHub
  class PresentationObserver
  class TickBackgroundService
  class AutoCheckBackgroundService
  class GameManager
}

package "表现" {
  class PlayPage
  class ProductionView
  class WorldPage
  class GodotViews
}

WorkshopService --> JarSystem
OrderService --> JarSystem
ProductionService --> JarSystem
MasterSwitchCoordinator --> JarSystem
RuntimePart ..> JarSystem : 同一 partial 门面

JarSystem --> ProcessSystem
JarSystem --> WorldBus
JarSystem --> WorldTime
JarSystem --> StateSerializer : GetState()
JarSystem --> WorldCommand : Record

ProcessSystem --> TickPipeline
TickPipeline --> WorldScheduler
ProcessSystem --> IWorldEventSource
ProcessSystem --> IProcessAdvancer
ProcessSystem --> IProcessObserver
ProcessSystem --> ProcessJournal

StateSerializer --> StateDto
SessionReplay --> WorldCommand
SessionReplay --> JarSystem

JarSystemService *-- JarSystem : 当前世界
JarSystemService --> CommandDispatcher : 组合
WebSocketHub --> CommandDispatcher : 收发
PresentationObserver --> WebSocketHub : 帧广播
TickBackgroundService --> JarSystemService
AutoCheckBackgroundService --> JarSystemService

CommandDispatcher --> JarSystem : 未知命令解析后调用
PlayPage --> ProductionView
WorldPage --> WebSocketHub
GodotViews --> GameManager
GameManager --> JarSystem

note right of RuntimePart
  编译期 partial，不是第二个实例。
  `JarSystem` 仍只有一个运行时对象；
  拆分只用于把时间、tick、产出配置、
  重置职责放在同一组合根的另一文件中。
end note

note bottom of JarSystemService
  **宿主生命周期边界**
  · Gate 串行化命令、tick、换关与自动分析；
  · 所有后台任务必须在 Gate 内重新读取 System；
  · 换关后重新绑定关卡订单、场景作用域和表现订阅。
end note

note right of StateSerializer
  读模型不写世界、不做业务判断。
  页面与 Godot 都消费同一份 DTO；
  生产卡不自行计算槽位或流入规则。
end note
@enduml
